  "description": "Prop library (src/props/library.js), placement (src/props/placement.js), signage atlases (src/props/signage.js), decal atlas (src/props/decals.js). All builders are parametric and draw into per-zone merge buckets (props-gs / props-gp / props-f1) via the Frame/Kit system in src/props/kit.js; static clutter for a whole zone collapses to one mesh per material. Colliders use world.add({min,max,material,tag:'prop'}) and are added for anything knee-height or taller that should block movement/shots; small clutter has none. Placement runs before nav bake; verified with tools/nav-props.mjs (all checkpoints reach garage, both escort routes walkable, patrols reachable).",
